#: packs/official/wallet/README.md
msgid ""
"Frames are often left without a password or shared with family, yet some apps hold private things. This protects just those apps, without locking the whole headset. It also fixes the Frame's two sessions (VR and desktop) each having their own wallet, which lose each other's logins."
msgstr ""

